{#-
  Instantly sequence-body snippet. Paste via Code View, never by dragging an
  image in — Instantly warns that pasted images render broken.

  Rules enforced here come from mta-instantly-campaign/references/instantly-csv.md:
    * alt text is required, because most clients block images by default
    * no wrapping <a> unless a real click target exists
    * the email must read completely with images off — the GIF is never load-bearing
-#}
{%- if link_url -%}
<a href="{{ link_url }}" target="_blank" style="text-decoration:none;">
  <img src="{{ gif_url }}" width="{{ width }}" alt="{{ alt|e }}" style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:{{ width }}px;height:auto;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;" />
</a>
{%- else -%}
<img src="{{ gif_url }}" width="{{ width }}" alt="{{ alt|e }}" style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:{{ width }}px;height:auto;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;" />
{%- endif %}
